  - afternoon
  - evening
- Continue this approach across Day 1, Day 2 and Day 3.
- Send WhatsApp after RNR attempts.
- Do not call back-to-back.
- Continue follow-up over the month as appropriate.

The supporting follow-up recording additionally emphasizes:
- Stretching the initial counselling conversation appropriately.
- Moving follow-up to WhatsApp Business.
- Asking for a specific reconnect time.
- If the learner does not respond, do not intrude repeatedly in the same moment.
- Try again the next day.
- Continue appropriate follow-up throughout the month.

